Historical origin

This repository began in 2023 as a fork of "Generative Agents: Interactive
Simulacra of Human Behavior" (Smallville):

    https://github.com/joonspk-research/generative_agents
    Copyright 2023 Joon Sung Park
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

No code or assets from that project remain in this repository. The simulation
code (reverie/, environment/) was removed from every branch, and the last
derived assets -- the rendered village map and the character sprite sheets --
were removed on 2026-08-14. The village map and every character likeness that
ships today are original artwork made for this game.

The upstream code remains present in this repository's git history, and the
attribution above is retained for that reason.
